Package: kwrited
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: Receive local console messages as Plasma notifications
 Kwrited receives local write(1) and wall(1) messages through a
 pseudo-terminal and displays them through the Plasma notification service.
 .
 This package is part of the KDE base workspace module.
